{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460770/extras/684efffd36ccb7a411d44c10aa52459a.poster.avif?t=1762182838\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460770/extras/684efffd36ccb7a411d44c10aa52459a.webm?t=1762182838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460770/extras/684efffd36ccb7a411d44c10aa52459a.mp4?t=1762182838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue Melee</strong> is an action Roguelike where you fight your way through a randomly generated dungeon. As you descend deeper, every floor has a unique theme, cast of enemies, bosses and treasure to find. Additionally, you will also acquire stronger weapons and items that empower you on your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll fight your enemies in a fast-paced, melee-oriented combat style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can be found throughout the dungeon in chests, secret rooms, behind boxes or as drops from stronger monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These will help you immensely, as they empower you with unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460770/extras/1562c3fd29cd36065d5e6423ca90c044.poster.avif?t=1762182838\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460770/extras/1562c3fd29cd36065d5e6423ca90c044.webm?t=1762182838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460770/extras/1562c3fd29cd36065d5e6423ca90c044.mp4?t=1762182838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dungeon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run, the dungeon is randomly generated. Its rooms are well designed and handcrafted, shuffled and placed in a maze/zelda-like structure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies &amp; Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll encounter a<strong> </strong>lot of interesting enemies and challenging bosses, who are eager to test how well you handle your sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460770/extras/427381099e7a1b84485075c873d2ef24.poster.avif?t=1762182838\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460770/extras/427381099e7a1b84485075c873d2ef24.webm?t=1762182838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460770/extras/427381099e7a1b84485075c873d2ef24.mp4?t=1762182838\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3460770?t=1762182838","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3460770?t=1762182838","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460770/90433e566a47b324ef22d1dafe4e8c6545593fdc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762182838","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460770/90433e566a47b324ef22d1dafe4e8c6545593fdc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762182838","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":6